cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Nimbus, please cite it as below."
title: "Nimbus: the live weather of a digital school"
abstract: >-
  An instrumented overlay on the Open Provision Drawings (OAP-001 The Digital
  Premises, OAP-002 The Services Layer): the live instrument reading of one
  provision's architecture. Rooms and seals are the primitives and the six
  field-states of The Weather of Knowing describe the field, with three role
  views — safeguarding lead, board, and an external inspection chamber that
  cannot be locked from inside. Nimbus monitors the institution, never the
  child: every tile describes a system, a connection, or an adult's
  accountability. Prototype; telemetry is mocked.
